    "updated_at": "2019-10-09T19:18:12Z",
    "body": "I doubt such a change is Web compatible today. Things like borders and margin would cease to work if we changed it to use `display: contents`. Given authors can easily add such a rule, I don’t think we should change the UA to do it at this point in time even though it may have been a good idea.",
