    "body": "> if an author is using those and relying on that side-effect rather than setting display: block explicitly, then we'd have a problem.\r\n\r\nStyles with block-ifying side effects includes a lot of common ones, like `float`, or a parent flex/grid container, so I don't think we can consider this to be a minor edge case without some conclusive data.",
