    "created_at": "2024-08-30T09:47:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-08-30T09:47:41Z",
    "body": "It's a pity the issue was closed, although I understand the reasoning behind it.\r\n\r\nStill I think the proposed `display contents;` for the `<picture>` element would be an adequate behaviour in case of `display: grid;` blocks, otherwise one needs to apply grid-positioning properties on the element itself and all other properties (like sizing ones) on its `<img>` element child.\r\n\r\nAlthough the local fix of `picture { display: contents; } picture > source { display: none; }` is rather trivial, nonetheless having to do the fix in every project bothers me a bit.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
